p: .
t. 
|  In one discussion that elucidates metascientific
|  background for syntactic theory, Hubert Kowalewski
|  presents the work of Ronald Langacker, and by extension
|  Cognitive Grammar overall, in terms of Structural Empiricism: Viewed through the lens of structural empiricism, Cognitive Grammar
.  is therefore a family of models of a linguistic system


