|  (attentional foci, \clrmAlt{9}{51}say) become manifest,
|  within communicative intent and staging, as
|  linguistic phenomena (e.g., that to which
|  I can perceptually attend becomes a noun; attributes
.  noticed so to do this become adjectives, etc.)

