-i  3
-t  Concepts and CompositionalityThe meaning of a sentence is a function of its words and
how they are composed (cf. )  In itself, that seems uncontroversial,
except that words are not combined per se; rather,
the concepts to which they point  There are two
key questions: how this pointing works; and how
concepts are combined


--- Sentence/switch
