id: 302
r#  52728  970  38


--- Sentence//end
id: 302
r#  52893  973  30
p: .
t. 
|   Meanwhile,
|  syntactically, that compositional motif is cued by the left-adjacency of
|  red before box, which in English binds
.  adjectives to nominal targets


--- Sentence/switch
id: 303
r#  52894  973  31


--- Sentence//end
id: 303
r#  53002  975  38
p: .
t. 
|   Thus we have a
|  syntactic operation/relation (left-adjacency) and a
.  semantic operation (set-intersection)


--- Sentence/switch
id: 304
r#  53003  975  39


--- Sentence//end
id: 304
r#  53232  979  30
p: .
t. 
|   The gist
|  of [/Bolt/] is that mapping the phrase to its signification
|  depends not just on mapping the two words but also
|  mapping the intra-Category morphisms to each other (adjacency
.  projects to set-intersection)

--- Sentence/end 
id: 304
r#  53233  979  31

