|  project morphisms (transforms in Categories) from one Category
|  to another, \clrmr{9}{46}assemblies of syntactic operations
|  project onto semantic/conceptual structures systematically,
|  extending the lexicon-to-concept functor to aggregate
.  phrases


--- Sentence/switch
