p: .
t. 
|   (Philosophically,
|  the concept of a phrase itself may be emergent/derivative.)In presenting conceptual syntheses, then, verbs operate via structures
.  of roles rather than one-word-at-a-time reworking of conceptual syntheses


--- Sentence/switch
