r#  99882  1896  55


--- Sentence//end
id: 572
r#  100096  1901  8
p: .
t. 
|  During talk, we exploit these capabilities
|  to synchronize behavior among two or more people,
|  leveraging future-oriented cognitive routines even
|  when the focus of our discourse exists in the immediate
.  present


--- Sentence/switch
id: 573
r#  100097  1901  9


--- Sentence//end
id: 573
r#  100342  1905  31
p: .
t. 
|   Cooperation between multiple individuals engenders
|  abstracting demands, refactoring perceptual experience
|  into propositional/enactive schemata (perhaps we can find this
